  sentences:
  - text: ...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 201f6469e4184ed47ad1425f0931fb16, type: 2}
  - text: It has been four weeks since you last came to work.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 201f6469e4184ed47ad1425f0931fb16, type: 2}
  - text: Not a word from your employees since then.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 201f6469e4184ed47ad1425f0931fb16, type: 2}
  - text: Whilst you didn't expect them to check up on you, it doesn't sting any
      less.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 201f6469e4184ed47ad1425f0931fb16, type: 2}
  - text: There's no time for moping, though. You have a job to do.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 201f6469e4184ed47ad1425f0931fb16, type: 2}
  - text: The Flame & Fork Bistro looms above, fast asleep, along with the rest of
      the street.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 201f6469e4184ed47ad1425f0931fb16, type: 2}
  - text: 'There''s a sheet of paper stuck to the door:'
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 201f6469e4184ed47ad1425f0931fb16, type: 2}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4d5bb6b3cb69ffc4ea74286149f513f1, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e156a190bde95b43abdd40c1886a4a1, type: 2}
